      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I like this idea. Like allow it in \"Invite Only\" instances or something.\n\nBut VRChat doesn't handle you using multiple clients running at the same time. It seems random which client a friend can see on their friendlist, and info panel can't show you are in multiple instances at the same time. I would love to see all these issues somehow resolved.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-06-30T09:42:00.421Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "You used to be able to join an instance with multiple clients using the same account, but now it kicks out any extra clients you join with. I get the safety concerns and it can still be disallowed in public instances, but it should be allowed in your own private instance to test avatar and world features more easily. Right now people are getting around the problem by creating multiple accounts, and it's not ideal.",
